id: pm-slack-npwn
title: Bound lifecycle notification bursts with complete coalescing receipts
description: "Coalesce queued delivery events using the durable Slack outbox, separately from tracker-state digest and periodic standup reports."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-slack#151"
created_at: "2026-10-24T07:17:48.932Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T09:30:42.725Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Order permutations yield stable summaries; Urgent events bypass the batch; Every suppressed event appears in an omission or coalescing receipt
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-24T07:17:59.856Z",codex-agent,"Overlap check: pinned pm SDK exposes lifecycle history verification/replay and complete tracker reads, but no delivery coalescer. Existing slack digest summarizes current tracker state; pm-slack-standup produces periodic project reports and snapshot trends. This feature groups queued outbox lifecycle deliveries by item, destination and fixed time window. Reuse verified SDK history capture and durable delivery/reconciliation, with a pure typed planner, bounded CLI receipts and urgent-blocker bypass. No git dependency, tracker mutation or remote posting in preview."
  "2026-10-24T07:27:36.966Z",codex-agent,"Implementation uses a pure deterministic planner and the existing durable outbox. SDK verified history captures timestamp and priority per committed transition. Same-item/destination/fixed-window summaries retain source receipts; priority 0/1 and every blocker bypass routine bounds. Claims and group reconciliation fence concurrent senders and uncertain delivery. Public-data validation at main 0e4c89e: 87 items, 87 verified streams, 658 history entries, 222 lifecycle events; budget 5 produced 86 notifications (81 urgent plus 5 routine summaries covering 8 events), 133 deferred, zero waiting, 222 receipts, max summary 58 characters. Three order variants equal, zero-budget urgent-only, all exported tracker bytes unchanged. Priority 0 discovered in public data is supported as urgent. CLI source overlap rechecked at 06eff3bf1 and standup at f584c70; only CLI flag-list coalescing exists, unrelated to delivery."
  "2026-10-24T07:34:39.388Z",codex-agent,"Validation: linked targeted command passed 111 tests with zero failures, skips or cancellations; typecheck, test typecheck and docstring lint passed. Native Bun acceptance passed through the compiled entry: one recovered lifecycle plus two coalesced events, two acknowledged HTTP sends and zero duplicates in a no-git tracker. Planner targeted coverage is 100 percent lines, branches and functions. Behavioral revert proof: disabling grouping, disabling urgent classification, and truncating member receipts each made the relevant targeted test fail (one test, zero passes, one failure), restoring the exact source after each run. Additional SQLite trigger regression verifies that event-context refusal rolls back the intent and claim refusal rolls back all members before HTTP. Full npm and Bun release gates will run in CI because the host is saturated; thresholds remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-24T07:37:56.984Z",codex-agent,"Ready-for-review PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-slack/pull/151 . Source head 6c3c11c22c5b6963dce27859238c60e4109634c5 passed CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-slack/actions/runs/40074736357 : Node 22 and 26 each passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check, 318 tests per gate, zero failures/skips/cancellations, 100 percent lines/branches/functions over all three source files. Both native Bun acceptance jobs passed (one recovered lifecycle plus two coalesced events, two acknowledged HTTP sends, zero duplicates). CodeQL passed. Automated review evidence is missing: Greptile trial ended, Sourcery budget exhausted, CodeRabbit auto-review skipped by repository eligibility, Cubic neutral. No review approval is claimed. Scope complete for orchestrator review; item stays in progress and will be released, never closed. Final metadata-only head will rerun CI and the PR body will record that exact-head run. No pm CLI or SDK defect encountered."
  "2026-10-24T09:30:42.724Z",codex-agent,"Review round: retry cleanup releases members before removing group mappings. Audit covers claim, group, send completion, typed and transport failure, retry, crash recovery and reconciliation. Plan: SQLite critical sections plus unique attempt ownership; cleanup deletes only its own mappings and releases members last. Exercise two drainers on one non-git tracker at every SQL boundary, fault rollback and stale sender completion. Merge current main first; pinned host health currently reports an inherited pm-github host-version mismatch."
